1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,520
 If you're asking ChatGPT what stock to buy, you're cooked.

2
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:10,240
 A survey found 26% of Americans have used an AI chatbot to ask for financial advice.

3
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:12,800
 About a quarter of them actually did what it told them.

4
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:17,440
 And of the people who acted on it, 29% says it hurt their finances.

5
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:20,480
 Why? Because most people ask the wrong question.

6
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:21,360
 What should I buy?

7
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:24,320
 That's like asking a builder which house you should live in.

8
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:26,000
 They don't know anything about your life.

9
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,680
 But a builder is great as something else.

10
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:31,680
 You bring them a plan, they check it, they fix it, and then they build it.

11
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:33,280
 So use AI like a builder.

12
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:36,160
 You bring in your idea, not your wallet.

13
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:37,520
 Here are three prompts.

14
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:41,840
 Prompt 1: Turn my ideas into exact rules.

15
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:43,040
 When do I buy?

16
00:00:43,040 --> 00:00:43,840
 When do I sell?

17
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:46,000
 How much do I put in?

18
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,680
 And how much do I cut losses?

19
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:49,520
 That's your plan on paper.

20
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:51,600
 No more it looks cheap, just numbers.

21
00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:55,600
 Prompt 2: Find holes in my ideas.

22
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:57,040
 Make it argue against you.

23
00:00:57,040 --> 00:00:59,760
 Ask it what market conditions will break my idea.

24
00:00:59,760 --> 00:01:03,520
 That's the builder telling you the wall won't hold before you move it.

25
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:05,840
 Prompt 3: Ask it to turn it into code.

26
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:09,200
 Now your rules can be tested against past prices.

27
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:10,880
 That's called a backtest.

28
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:13,120
 You own the idea, AI builds it.

29
00:01:13,120 --> 00:01:16,000
 Now, you more than likely won't have access to historical data.

30
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:18,880
 And that's okay, because I can give you free access.

31
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:20,880
 Just comment Q and I'll send it over.

